# 🧠 2. Shadow-Map Two-Phase Commit

```c
/* ebpf/maps/live_shadow.h */
struct {
    __uint(type, BPF_MAP_TYPE_ARRAY_OF_MAPS);
    __uint(max_entries, 2);        /* [0] = shadow, [1] = active */
    __uint(key_size, sizeof(__u32));
    __uint(value_size, sizeof(int));
} live_shadow SEC(".maps");

/* atomic swap in 1µs */
static inline void commit_live(void) {
    __u32 shadow = 0, active = 1;
    bpf_map_update_elem(&live_shadow, &active, &shadow, BPF_ANY);
}
```

