# 🔒 7. Rollback on Panic

### 7.1 Kernel trigger
```go
// userspace/internal/watchdog/watchdog.go
func watchdog() {
    for {
        if err := syscall.PingVPP(); err != nil {
            log.Error("VPP dead, reverting to sim")
            api.SetMode(api.ModeSimulation)
            exec.Command("systemctl", "restart", "cerberus-vpp").Run()
        }
        time.Sleep(2 * time.Second)
    }
}
```

### 7.2 eBPF watchdog kretprobe
```c
SEC("kretprobe/vpp_crash")
int BPF_KRETPROBE(vpp_crash, int ret) {
    if (ret)
        bpf_printk("vpp panic, auto-revert\n");
    return 0;
}
```

